<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE - ICB interim profit up 7.6 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ICB interim profit up 7.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    42.04    vs    39.08</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	   25.00    vs    23.20</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)		 4.00    vs     4.00</p>
<p>    Interest income	    117.62    vs    97.46</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    51.96    vs    37.42</p>
<p>    Dividends			0.33    vs     0.16</p>
<p>    Fee and commission	   6.94    vs     6.13</p>
<p>    Other operating income    13.12    vs     8.57</p>
