<p>    Pre-tax profit		57.04    vs    54.20</p>
<p>    Tax			     14.73    vs    14.90</p>
<p>    Minorities		     0.28    vs     0.22</p>
<p>    Last day books open  -  August 25, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend pay date    -  September 4, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Industrial &amp; Commercial Bank Ltd is a unit of United Overseas Bank Ltd.</p>
